     "doc": {
      "summary": "HistogramGradientBoosting 的流式构造器",
      "body": [
       "默认值为 algorithm XGBOOST、objective SQUARED_ERROR、iterations 100、learningRate 0.1、maxDepth 6、maxLeaves 31、bins 64、minSamplesLeaf 1、minChildWeight 1e-12、lambda 1.0、gamma 0、threads 为可用处理器数、featureFraction 1.0、validationFraction 0、earlyStoppingRounds 0、seed 42。",
       "build() 集中校验数值范围与组合约束：早停必须配正的验证集比例，各比例参数有各自的半开区间。"
      ],
      "notes": [
       "maxLeaves 只在 LIGHTGBM 策略下生效，XGBOOST 由 maxDepth 决定形状",
       "lambda 参与叶权重与增益的分母，gamma 是每次分裂需超过的增益门槛"
      ],
      "example": "HistogramGradientBoosting model = HistogramGradientBoosting.builder()\n        .algorithm(BoostingAlgorithm.LIGHTGBM)\n        .objective(BoostingObjective.SQUARED_ERROR)\n        .iterations(300)\n        .learningRate(0.05)\n        .maxLeaves(31)\n        .minChildWeight(1e-3)\n        .lambda(1.0)\n        .gamma(0.0)\n        .featureFraction(0.8)\n        .validationFraction(0.2)\n        .earlyStoppingRounds(20)\n        .threads(4)\n        .seed(42L)\n        .build();",
      "see": [
       "basalt.ml.HistogramGradientBoosting",
       "basalt.ml.BoostingAlgorithm",
       "basalt.ml.BoostingObjective"
      ]
     }
