     "doc": {
      "summary": "IsolationForest 的流式构建器。",
      "body": [
       "四个字段默认 trees=100、maxSamples=256、contamination=0.1、seed=42；setter 返回 this 以便串联，参数越界在 setter 内立即抛 IllegalArgumentException。",
       "build() 以字段副本构造模型，不再做额外校验。maxSamples 只是上限，fit 时每棵树实际子采样 min(样本数, maxSamples) 行。"
      ],
      "notes": [
       "contamination 不参与建树，只在 fit 末尾决定判定阈值：训练集异常分数升序排序后取 floor(rows × contamination) 位置",
       "树高上限为 ceil(log2(有效子采样数))，trees 与 maxSamples 直接决定内存占用与耗时",
       "构建器不是线程安全的，配置完成后应尽快 build()"
      ],
      "example": "IsolationForest model = IsolationForest.builder()\n        .trees(200)\n        .maxSamples(128)\n        .contamination(0.05)\n        .seed(7L)\n        .build();",
      "see": [
       "basalt.ml.IsolationForest",
       "basalt.ml.IsolationForest.anomalyScore(Matrix)"
      ]
     }
